ntainer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Address the challenges of climate change and extreme climates:<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf1bed6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cf1bed6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e4f5d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1e4f5d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>By understanding climate change impacts, creating adaptive strategies, and using advanced techniques &amp; data resources<\/p><p>Toward this goal, we strive to comprehend climate change impacts, devise adaptive resource management strategies, and leverage advanced techniques and data sources.<\/p><p>Management Strategies for natural resources can largely depend on Geographical Locations and Socioeconomic &amp; Climate Conditions. To properly understand and resolve water-related issues under global environmental changes, we must develop new approaches to help policymakers formulate actionable measures.<\/p><p><strong>In conclusion, we&#8217;re interested in&#8230; Measuring Climatic and Socioeconomic Risks in Hydrologic Processes to Improve Water Management Decisions<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2baeb89 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2baeb89\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec55fa6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"ec55fa6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-conta